# Watery Grasp, "Enchant creature" and "Waterbend {5}: Enchanted creature's owner shuffles it into their library." Bot1 enchants Bot2's Grizzly Bears on turn 3 with one Mox (a Mox is
# refused as the target: it is no creature) and pays the {5} with five taps, four more Moxen and its Memnite, so the pool is empty
# and nothing else is tapped. The Bears go from the battlefield to Bot2's library (15 -> 16 cards, not its graveyard) and the Grasp, left with nothing to
# enchant, goes to Bot1's graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Memnite
Watery Grasp
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Grizzly Bears
Island x20

